.TH ROCKETSCIENCE 1
.SH NAME
rocketscience \- guided rocket game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/rocketscience
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I RocketScience
is a guided rocket game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Space launches a guided rocket at a flying target. Enter resets.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B space
Launch
.TP
.B Enter
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
